Subject: [PATCH] feat(session,test): add data-action anchors for session rename + delete flows (G5.5)

Staged for Phase G5.5 session-components surface test suite. The session
header dropdown menu exposes Rename / Archive / Delete actions, but none of
them carry a stable data-action attribute. Tests currently fall back to
i18n label text, which is locale-dependent and breaks on translation churn.

This patch adds:
- data-action="session-menu-open" on the dropdown trigger icon
- data-action="session-menu-rename" on the Rename item
- data-action="session-menu-archive" on the Archive item
- data-action="session-menu-delete" on the Delete item
- data-action="session-title-input" on the inline title editor
- data-action="session-delete-confirm" on the delete dialog confirm button

Pairs with tests/surfaces/test_session_components.py (xfail-staged until
this patch lands on gpd-app main).

diff --git a/packages/app/src/pages/session/message-timeline.tsx b/packages/app/src/pages/session/message-timeline.tsx
--- a/packages/app/src/pages/session/message-timeline.tsx
+++ b/packages/app/src/pages/session/message-timeline.tsx
@@ (line ~789) InlineInput ref...
                           <InlineInput
                             ref={(el) => {
                               titleRef = el
                             }}
                             data-slot="session-title-child"
+                            data-action="session-title-input"
                             value={title.draft}
                             ...
@@ (line ~830) DropdownMenu.Trigger
                             <DropdownMenu.Trigger
                               as={IconButton}
                               icon="dot-grid"
                               variant="ghost"
                               class="size-6 rounded-md data-[expanded]:bg-surface-base-active"
                               ...
                               aria-label={language.t("common.moreOptions")}
+                              data-action="session-menu-open"
                               ...
                             />
@@ (line ~862) DropdownMenu.Item rename
                                 <DropdownMenu.Item
+                                  data-action="session-menu-rename"
                                   onSelect={() => {
                                     setTitle("pendingRename", true)
                                     setTitle("menuOpen", false)
                                   }}
                                 >
@@ (line ~881) DropdownMenu.Item archive
                                 <DropdownMenu.Item
+                                  data-action="session-menu-archive"
                                   onSelect={() => void archiveSession(id())}
                                 >
@@ (line ~885) DropdownMenu.Item delete
                                 <DropdownMenu.Item
+                                  data-action="session-menu-delete"
                                   onSelect={() => dialog.show(() => <DialogDeleteSession sessionID={id()} />)}
                                 >

diff --git a/packages/app/src/pages/session/message-timeline.tsx b/packages/app/src/pages/session/message-timeline.tsx
(DialogDeleteSession body, around line 596)
+ The dialog's confirm button needs data-action="session-delete-confirm".
